        "jsCode": "const students = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\n\n// Filter active students who haven't completed their 4-week roadmap yet\nconst activeCohort = students.filter(s => s.email && s.status !== 'GRADUATED_COMPLETED');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    activeCohortCount: activeCohort.length,\n    activeStudents: activeCohort,\n    checkedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
